system "Two tabs editing one revision"

types
  interchangeable user is one of alice, bob

state
  revision is an integer from 0 to 2
  seen is a map from user to an integer from 0 to 2

initially
  revision is 0
  seen of every user is 0

action refresh(u is a user)
  seen of u becomes revision

action save(u is a user)
  requires revision is less than 2
  requires seen of u is revision
  revision becomes revision + 1
  seen of u becomes revision + 1

scenario "An old tab must refresh before saving"
  save(alice)
  reject save(bob)
  refresh(bob)
  save(bob)
  expect revision is 2
